/E (To bridge this gap, the government introduced Form GST DRC-03A. This is a "linking tool" that allows a taxpayer to map a previously paid DRC-03 to a specific Demand ID generated by an Order \(such as an Assessment Order under Section 73 or 74\). Once this link is established, the payment is reflected in the Electronic Liability Register \(Part II\), and the portal recognizes it as a valid pre-deposit.)
