/Title (The GST Portal has recently moved from "Summary Filing" to "Detailed Filing." The most significant change is the new requirement to provide a Tax Liability Breakup within the GSTR-3B. Previously, if you missed reporting an invoice in January and reported it in February, you would simply add it to the February totals. Now, the portal requires you to explicitly state which portion of your current tax payment belongs to which previous tax period.)
