/Title (As we transition from Financial Year 2025-26 to 2026-27, the most fundamental task for every registered taxpayer is the commencement of a new, unique invoice numbering series. Under Rule 46\(b\) of the CGST Rules, 2017, every tax invoice must have a consecutive serial number that is unique for a specific financial year. Repeating a number from a previous year is not just a clerical error but it is a compliance failure that can halt your supply chain.)
